answers.approach:
Don’t build one grand ontology to make all systems rhyme;
Pick one activation path, version its terms in time.

Have owners sign each meaning, source, and purpose-bound decree;
Then test which rows and fields each agent gets to see.

Keep policy past the transport, pass identity clear through;
Fail closed on broken lineage, and log what agents do.

Swap adapters as specs wander; let conformance testing grow;
Yet politics and cross-tool rights stay unsolved, we know.
